      "answer_index": 2,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由于正态随机变量的线性组合仍为正态随机变量，且}\\\\&amp;Y=2X_1+3X_2-X_3\\sim N(2\\mu_1+3\\mu_2-\\mu_3,4\\sigma_1^2+9\\sigma_2^2+\\sigma_3^2)=N(0,36),\\\\&amp;\\text{而}\\quad U=\\frac{Y-0}{6}\\sim N(0,1),\\\\&amp;\\text{故}\\quad P\\{0\\leq 2X_1+3X_2-X_3\\leq 6\\}=P\\{0\\leq Y\\leq 6\\}\\\\&amp;\\quad=P\\{\\frac{0-0}{6}\\leq \\frac{Y-0}{6}\\leq \\frac{6-0}{6}\\}=P\\{0\\leq U\\leq 1\\}=\\Phi(1)-\\Phi(0),\\\\&amp;\\text{查表得，}\\Phi(1)-\\Phi(0)=0.8413-0.5=0.3413.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由于正态随机变量的线性组合仍为正态随机变量，且}\\\\&amp;Y=2X_1+3X_2-X_3\\sim N(2\\mu_1+3\\mu_2-\\mu_3,4\\sigma_1^2+9\\sigma_2^2+\\sigma_3^2)=N(0,36),\\\\&amp;\\text{而}\\quad U=\\frac{Y-0}{6}\\sim N(0,1),\\\\&amp;\\text{故}\\quad P\\{0\\leq 2X_1+3X_2-X_3\\leq 6\\}=P\\{0\\leq Y\\leq 6\\}\\\\&amp;\\quad=P\\{\\frac{0-0}{6}\\leq \\frac{Y-0}{6}\\leq \\frac{6-0}{6}\\}=P\\{0\\leq U\\leq 1\\}=\\Phi(1)-\\Phi(0),\\\\&amp;\\text{查表得，}\\Phi(1)-\\Phi(0)=0.8413-0.5=0.3413.\\end{aligned}</div>"
